# Drift Index — environment templates
#
# Local dev (default): shared prod DB + prod media via Vite proxy
#   apps/api/.env.example  → cp to apps/api/.env
#   apps/web/.env.development (committed, loaded automatically)
#
# Fully offline local stack:
#   apps/api/.env.local.example → cp to apps/api/.env
#   npm run db:setup:local
#
# VPS production:
#   apps/api/.env.production.example → cp to apps/api/.env on server
